      ],
      "text": "The spec requires AGENT.md to be placed in a project's root directory and written in Markdown, and recommends sections covering structure, commands, style, architecture, testing, and security."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ef50337cb48de0fa54c2697b5b03cfcee4379b43ddfbd01899da3cb3a22d9485",
