        "slc_b8fd108d6a7e1cab613c2f183f6b2836d103177b7d05d3eb12f94589abe3e3f3"
      ],
      "text": "Implementations should support a hierarchy of AGENT.md files: root-level for general guidance, subdirectory files for subsystems, and a user-global file at ~/.config/AGENT.md."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5067f6b6eff20813a3338de177d6a9ae52bf24db706f45a20419e9b55659ca3c",
